    \r\nStatue of Liberty Tour \u2013 2 hrs ($30)  \r\nBike Ride Through Central
    Park \u2013 1 hr ($25)  \r\nMuseum of the City of New York \u2013 3 hrs ($25) 
    \r\nDinner at a Rooftop Restaurant \u2013 1.5 hrs ($75)  \r\nChelsea Market Exploration
    \u2013 1 hr ($50)  \r\nSoHo Shopping Spree \u2013 1.5 hrs ($50)  \r\nHigh Line
    Park Stroll \u2013 1 hr ($0)  \r\nShopping at Rockefeller Plaza \u2013 1 hr ($50) 
    \r\nNew York Public Library Tour \u2013 1 hr ($10)  \r\nNight-time Helicopter
    Ride \u2013 1 hr ($100)  \r\nEmpire State Building Visit \u2013 1 hr ($50)  \r\nWall
    Street Tour \u2013 1.5 hr ($15)  \r\nGrand Central Terminal Tour \u2013 1 hr
